{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Rollout state",
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "description": "What this shows:\nStable, canary, shadow, paused, rollback, and complete state with active app/model/prompt/index/config versions.\n\nWhy you care:\nRelease state is the first fact needed for rollback decisions.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare rollout phase with SLO, behavior, and dependency panels; any behavior or SLO issue must be interpreted against what is live.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect the canary user-impact and behavior difference panels next.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*state.*|.*current.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "Normal",
                        "color": "green"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "Watch",
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "text": "Incident",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "text": "Recovering",
                        "color": "blue"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*hypothesis.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "normal",
                        "color": "green"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "infra",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "text": "capacity",
                        "color": "orange"
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "text": "dependency",
                        "color": "orange"
                      },
                      "4": {
                        "text": "deploy",
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      "5": {
                        "text": "behavior",
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      "6": {
                        "text": "retrieval",
                        "color": "orange"
                      },
                      "7": {
                        "text": "agent",
                        "color": "orange"
                      },
                      "8": {
                        "text": "mixed",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "9": {
                        "text": "recovering",
                        "color": "blue"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*rollout.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "stable",
                        "color": "green"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "shadow",
                        "color": "blue"
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "text": "canary",
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "text": "paused",
                        "color": "orange"
                      },
                      "4": {
                        "text": "rollback",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "5": {
                        "text": "complete",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*trust.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "trusted",
                        "color": "green"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "stale_baseline",
                        "color": "orange"
                      },
                      "2": {
                        "text": "low_volume",
                        "color": "yellow"
                      },
                      "3": {
                        "text": "missing_source",
                        "color": "orange"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.9,
        "showValue": "never"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (traffic_role) (metricchrono_sre_ai_rollout_state_code{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} rollout",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (app_version) (metricchrono_sre_ai_app_version_active{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",app_version=~\".*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "app {{app_version}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (active_model_version) (metricchrono_sre_ai_model_version_active{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",active_model_version=~\".*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "model {{active_model_version}}",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (prompt_version) (metricchrono_sre_ai_prompt_version_active{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",prompt_version=~\".*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "prompt {{prompt_version}}",
          "refId": "D",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (index_version) (metricchrono_sre_ai_index_version_active{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",index_version=~\".*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "index {{index_version}}",
          "refId": "E",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (config_version) (metricchrono_sre_ai_config_version_active{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",config_version=~\".*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "config {{config_version}}",
          "refId": "F",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Canary user impact",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "What this shows:\nCanary versus stable error rate, p95 latency, and SLO burn.\n\nWhy you care:\nSREs prioritize user impact before behavior analysis.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare canary to stable and canary to the SLO; if canary is worse on user-facing SLIs, pause or roll back before deeper behavior work.\n\nWhat to do next:\nIf user impact is present, use the fast-burn or latency runbook.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (traffic_role) (rate(metricchrono_sre_ai_errors_total{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} errors",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le,traffic_role) (rate(metricchrono_sre_ai_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\",outcome=\"success\"}[2m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_slo_burn_rate{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\",window=\"short\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} short burn",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Canary behavior difference",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "What this shows:\nBehavior-change comparing canary to stable and previous version.\n\nWhy you care:\nAI releases can change behavior before classic service metrics fail.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare canary against stable, previous version, and watch/incident bands; a high difference with normal SLIs means investigate before full rollout.\n\nWhat to do next:\nUse release-behavior-regression runbook if the difference persists.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_canary_behavior_difference_score{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=\"canary\"}",
          "legendFormat": "canary vs stable",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_previous_version_behavior_change_score{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=\"canary\"}",
          "legendFormat": "canary vs previous version",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vector(50)",
          "legendFormat": "watch band",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "vector(75)",
          "legendFormat": "incident evidence band",
          "refId": "D",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "What changed in the canary?",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "description": "What this shows:\nCanary input, embedding, output, retrieval, agent workflow, and source disagreement differences.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis points the rollout issue to the owning team.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare canary components against stable and previous version; output high with input low points to model or prompt, retrieval high points to index or retriever, and agent high points to tools.\n\nWhat to do next:\nRoute to the owner of the highest canary component.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_behavior_component_score{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=\"canary\",component=~\".*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{component}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Dependency and cost difference",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "What this shows:\nToken usage, provider duration, provider rate limits, provider errors, and cost proxy for canary versus stable.\n\nWhy you care:\nAI releases can regress cost and capacity even when quality is acceptable.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare canary to stable and previous version; more tokens or slower provider calls may be a release regression.\n\nWhat to do next:\nPause rollout if dependency or cost regression is material.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (traffic_role) (rate(metricchrono_sre_ai_token_usage_total{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} tokens/sec",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le,traffic_role) (rate(metricchrono_sre_ai_provider_duration_seconds_bucket{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\",provider=~\".*\"}[2m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} provider p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (traffic_role) (rate(metricchrono_sre_ai_provider_rate_limits_total{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} rate limits",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (traffic_role) (rate(metricchrono_sre_ai_provider_errors_total{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} provider errors",
          "refId": "D",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_cost_proxy{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"canary|stable\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{traffic_role}} cost proxy",
          "refId": "E",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Blast radius by workload",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "What this shows:\nWorkload, service, environment, model, version, traffic role, SLO state, behavior state, and quality proxy.\n\nWhy you care:\nScope determines whether to pause a canary or investigate a global issue.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare canary versus stable and top affected workloads by severity; if only canary is affected, pause rollout.\n\nWhat to do next:\nUse the top affected workload to target mitigation.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_next_action_candidate{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",rank=~\".*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{workload}} {{traffic_role}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "model_version": "model version",
              "traffic_role": "traffic role",
              "likely_cause": "likely cause",
              "next_step": "next step",
              "slo_state": "SLO state",
              "behavior_state": "behavior state",
              "runbook": "runbook"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rollback evidence",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "What this shows:\nSignal, current value, comparator, severity, first seen, owner, and suggested action.\n\nWhy you care:\nRollback recommendations need evidence, not just a graph.\n\nHow to read it:\nCompare SLO burn, canary versus stable, previous-version behavior, quality proxy, and dependency health; rows should make the rollback argument explicit.\n\nWhat to do next:\nUse the suggested action and owner in the change-management workflow.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 75
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "metricchrono_sre_ai_rollback_evidence{service=~\"$service\",environment=~\"$environment\",model=~\"$model\",model_version=~\"$model_version\",workload=~\"$workload\",stream=~\"$stream\",traffic_role=~\"$traffic_role\",signal=~\".*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{signal}} {{severity}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
